WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.550
Let’s walk through PLI Reports.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:06.500
Choose report scope deliberately and confirm all included specialist seats

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.838
are finalized.

00:00:07.838 --> 00:00:10.213
Reports summarize existing evidence;

00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:13.137
generating a report must never create, approve, or

00:00:13.137 --> 00:00:15.000
alter an adjudication.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.962
On this slide, generate session-, move-, or

00:00:17.962 --> 00:00:21.587
action-scoped reports from finalized specialist outputs.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:25.025
In practice, reports summarize finalized evidence;

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.962
they do not create or change an adjudication.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.485
When you are ready, use Open PLI Reports to

00:00:31.485 --> 00:00:33.273
move to the live surface.

00:00:33.273 --> 00:00:35.985
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:36.135
.
